<view class="page"><view class="me-intro"><image class="me-leaf" src="/assets/leaf-active.png"/><view class="eyebrow">MY LITTLE JOURNAL</view><view class="heading">日子，值得被记住。</view><view class="sub me-sub">这是只属于你自己的生活手记。</view></view><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view>
<view class="card me-stats"><view><text>{{stats.total}}</text><view>累计日记</view></view><view><text>{{stats.month}}</text><view>本月记录</view></view><view><text>{{stats.streak}}</text><view>连续天数</view></view></view>
<view class="notice me-notice">你的 {{stats.words}} 字生活片段，保存在当前设备。这里不提供账号登录与云端同步，换机、删除小程序或清理缓存前，请先备份。</view>
<view class="card menu"><view class="link-row" bindtap="backup" role="button"><view>备份与恢复<view class="small muted">按月保管好自己的记录</view></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="link-row" data-type="privacy" bindtap="info" role="button"><text>隐私说明</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="link-row" data-type="terms" bindtap="info" role="button"><text>使用说明</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="link-row" data-type="about" bindtap="info" role="button"><text>关于拾日手记</text><text class="arrow">›</text></view><button class="feedback" open-type="feedback">使用反馈<text class="arrow">›</text></button></view>
<button class="quiet danger full clear" bindtap="clear">清空日记与草稿</button><view class="footer-note">拾日手记 v{{version}}<view>{{filing ? filing : '备案信息以小程序资料页展示为准'}}</view></view></view>
